{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ab9b093ed095da2b1de9af86629d56290046d3aeda435fa11741e5db0295aab8","ja":"楽しい時間はあっという間で","zh":"快乐的时光转瞬即逝","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fc2110d2bd79406e771ab961e6fe1835d4d81bb9ff65068f70f1d988e61e2025","ja":"この近くで楽しめるプランは以上になりますわ。\n少し足を伸ばせば、他にもありますわよ。","zh":"在这附近能享受游玩的方案就这些了。\n要是走远一点的话，也还有其他选择哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a5ff92402f2f0346cd2b79b22da26c6bc212eca7059e704162703a1bb7213521","ja":"すっげーな！\nそれだと、どんなプランがあるんだ？","zh":"太厉害了！\n要是那样的话，都有些什么方案啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"08387a4e846123a44fa174b799a36c16267ce443b422145b935c4239ecc16f88","ja":"そうですわね♪　例えば……。","zh":"说得也是呢♪　比如……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ff4299c4ae60fc4e15f0916ea614b6c75099524d9ad78155bf160a68537ad41e","ja":"あ、あの……千鶴さんのプラン、どれも面白そうで、\n全部、行きたくなったんですけど……。","zh":"那、那个……千鹤小姐的计划，看起来都很有意思，\n我都想去个遍了呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"96a5819ce1480661f99abbac2107b2a83eec74145127d423519a0aafc23b963c","ja":"その、そろそろ次のお仕事の時間が……！","zh":"那个，差不多到下一份工作的时间了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5a8cf3c163f9b2abe6a4f25738f0ed9207f7dbe627e50919657f73b4c24140fd","ja":"…………えっ！\nもうこんな時間なんですの！？","zh":"…………咦！\n已经这个时间了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c87fa9aece1b5bacce3cf2cd3e07c2c349d11e94c92332525c7e10eff137f115","ja":"せっかくの空き時間、みんなに楽しんでもらおうと\n思っていましたのに……。","zh":"难得有空闲时间，本想着让大家\n好好开心一下的，结果却……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"56e68719115c340fdab32853fe0cf9a13984040659ba01339359aa26920b527c","ja":"気にすんなって！　千鶴の話を聞いてるだけで\nすっげー楽しかったからさ！","zh":"别放在心上啦！光是听千鹤说话\n我就已经超开心了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"39e116937ff421ea756b66944363b7afcb45d7ca22af9bc31b12e8c7484e5ff1","ja":"ありさも楽しかったです！\n千鶴さんのお話しを聞きながら、妄想を……。","zh":"亚利沙也玩得很开心！\n边听千鹤小姐说话，边展开了妄想……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"1d006b6e2004927c5a657c2612ff1ca4d83851314eaee0dd39f16e1732d5052b","ja":"じゃなくて！　想像を膨らませて、\nみんなで遊びに行った気分を満喫しちゃいました！","zh":"不对啦！我发挥想象力，\n好好享受了一把大家一起去玩的氛围！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"62d5369064aaecb5d5ff79575628dfd697f77d2d59838591c1cdd030262b0c72","ja":"あ、亜利沙ちゃん……千鶴さんのお話を聞きながら、\n目を閉じて、ずっと、ニコニコしてたよね♪","zh":"啊，亚利沙……听千鹤说话的时候，\n闭着眼睛，一直都在笑眯眯的呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"2bc17e259e15b5b3399b02c962c794aff4e1977d43b263488e3a4b9c57628aac","ja":"そう言ってもらえると助かります……。","zh":"您能这么说真是帮了大忙……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"8eb06adf619dd338bffa53878a76dadb836b369bfa076d9f1b5dc7c7aef63612","ja":"ですが次こそは、紹介だけではなく、\n実際に遊びに行けるようにいたしますわ！","zh":"不过下次我一定会做到不仅是介绍，\n而是能实际去玩！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"2aca05b1ac71fa87e9231db89f7317d0b4305232957bc0f5eb2e98b71215649d","ja":"それじゃあ、次も期待してもいいのか？","zh":"那么，下次也可以期待一下吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1447.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"8cd6d959f75e7628a81d181421b64ded7e27722eaa6b4b1395d0752db690560f","ja":"お任せくださいまし！　今回よりさらに完璧なプランを\n用意してみせましてよ！　おーっほっほっほ！","zh":"就包在我身上吧！我一定会准备好\n比这次还要更加完美的方案给您看的！哦～呵呵呵！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
